@startuml
title Resumefolio | Recovery evidence roadmap
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Define recovery loss scenario, usable state and RPO / RTO criteria;
:Identify required records, artifacts, configuration and access relationships;
if (Coverage, storage access and safe isolated drill ready?) then (yes)
 :Select identified consistent recovery point / reconciliation procedure;
 :Restore only in the authorized isolated environment;
 :Measure actual timing and recovered data loss;
 :Verify integrity, artifacts, references and core workflow outcomes;
 :Reconcile old grants, deleted data, provider state and pending external effects;
 if (Agreed coverage, access and recovery criteria supported?) then (yes)
  :Record supported bounded recovery evidence; <<#DCFCE7>>
 else (unmet / incomplete)
  :Record actual failures, limitations and required actions; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
else (pending)
 :Record missing prerequisites and dependent gate; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
:Route actual findings to the owner and readiness review;
stop
legend bottom
Evidence roadmap, not a live recovery instruction or a successful drill.
No numerical target, storage provider or automatic job replay selected.
Backup existence does not demonstrate restored usability or safe access.
endlegend
@enduml
